{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>渣打藝趣嘉年華於周日（15日）下午2時30分舉行「壓軸巡遊」，由銅鑼灣維園中央草坪出發，10座4米高巨型木偶將亮相，再加上逾500名穿上嘉年華服裝的青少年、舞蹈員、表演者，途經記利佐治街及崇光百貨，至東角道折返。市民毋須門票可免費觀賞。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-15T02:34:16.842546+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":118,"images":0,"source":"明報 消閒","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T02:05:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-15T02:27:33.004374+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-15T02:27:33.004374+00:00","content_hash":"d89c7113a18354da291c78c367002b37b1839b3be4fccd968815266d7455b036","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}